Description:

Support draft-ietf-jmap-object-history: Foo/get can return previous
versions of objects and destroyed objects, from the expunged messages and
deleted mailboxes that delayed expunge and delayed delete retain until
cyr_expire removes them.


Documentation:

docsrc/rfc-support.rst
lib/imapoptions/jmap_history_duration


Config changes:

jmap_history_duration


Upgrade instructions:

None.  History is only available with expunge_mode and delete_mode set to
delayed.  Set jmap_history_duration to match the cyr_expire -X and -D
durations so that clients see an accurate maxHistoryDuration.


